I am filing a complaint against Nouvure for unauthorized recurring charges to my card. I was charged $29.99 every month for a subscription that I did not knowingly authorize or agree to. On some occasions, I was charged $29.99 twice in the same month.
I did not authorize Nouvure to continue charging my card, and I did not knowingly agree to a monthly subscription. I have tried to stop these charges, but I continue to receive subscription-related messages from the company.
I am requesting that these unauthorized charges be investigated, that any eligible charges be refunded, and that Nouvure permanently stop charging my card.&nbsp;
